---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Shipping & returns — Transfer Chick"><div class="container-page py-14"><div class="max-w-3xl"><div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400">Shipping &amp; returns</div><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold">Straightforward aftercare.</h1><div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Shipping</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600">Orders are dispatched using tracked services where available. You’ll receive delivery updates at the email used for checkout. Delivery windows and rates are shown in Stripe Checkout.</p></div><div><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Returns</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600">Contact us within 30 days of delivery if you need to return an unworn, unwashed item. Keep the packaging while we sort the return with you.</p></div></div><div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-100 p-6 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-700">Personalised or altered items may be excluded from returns where permitted by law. This page is starter policy copy—replace it with your final legal policy before launch.</div></div></div></BaseLayout>
